ukycorpses.deathquote.1=Silence is also an answer.
ukycorpses.deathquote.2=Everything you carried now belongs to the ground.
ukycorpses.deathquote.3=One step too many.
ukycorpses.deathquote.4=The cold comes last.
ukycorpses.deathquote.5=No one heard you fall.
ukycorpses.deathquote.6=The road remembers everyone who stayed on it.
ukycorpses.deathquote.7=The light does not go out at once. It only grows distant.
ukycorpses.deathquote.8=You can return. You cannot forget.
ukycorpses.deathquote.9=A pack is heavier than it looks when no one is left to carry it.
ukycorpses.deathquote.10=That was a good try.
ukycorpses.deathquote.11=The earth takes everyone without asking.
ukycorpses.deathquote.12=Caution is cheap until it runs out.
ukycorpses.deathquote.13=Not every wound shows on the outside.
ukycorpses.deathquote.14=Fear told the truth, but you did not listen.
ukycorpses.deathquote.15=Somewhere a fire still burns, waiting for you.
ukycorpses.deathquote.16=The dust settles. Everything goes quiet.
ukycorpses.deathquote.17=Remember why you came.
ukycorpses.deathquote.18=Every scar began as a mistake.
ukycorpses.deathquote.19=The world did not notice. It never does.
ukycorpses.deathquote.20=Get up. The ground is cold.

